# Assignment 12: Code Refactoring Report

## Executive Summary

This report documents the comprehensive refactoring of the user management API system. The primary objective was to eliminate technical debt, improve performance, and implement enterprise-grade security practices.

### Refactored Components:
1. **`src/lib/database.ts`** - Database connection and transaction management
2. **`src/lib/user-service.ts`** - User business logic layer
3. **`src/lib/profile-service.ts`** - Profile management service (new)
4. **`src/lib/response-formatter.ts`** - API response standardization
5. **`src/lib/jwt.ts`** - Authentication and authorization
6. **`src/app/api/users/route.ts`** - Users API endpoint

